%% Telegram through OAN (caller: OAN Bot Services)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant T as OAN Bot Services (caller bot-services)
  participant OAN as OAN API and Telegram worker
  participant B as Telegram Bot API
  actor F as Farmer (has started the bot)
  T->>OAN: POST /messages/telegram (chat_id, text, purpose, optional reply_markup)
  OAN->>B: sendMessage via the bot (replies before broadcasts, one pace)
  B->>F: message
  T->>OAN: POST /messages/{id}/cancel (only while not yet claimed)
  T->>OAN: GET /messages/{id}
  OAN-->>T: sent = final (Telegram never reports delivered)
